#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Integration with &kate; features"
msgstr "सह एकीकरणम् &kate; गुणाः"

# automatic translation
#: vi.docbook:150
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Visual Mode is entered automatically when text is selected with the mouse. "
"It is also entered when using functions of &kate; that select text, such as "
"Select All (either from the menu or via <keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>A</keycap> </keycombo>.)"
msgstr ""
"मूषकेन पाठस्य चयनं कृत्वा Visual Mode स्वयमेव प्रविष्टं भवति । &kate; यत् "
"पाठं चिनोति, यथा सर्वं चिनोतु (मेनूतः वा <keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>A</keycap> </keycombo> मार्गेण वा ।)"

# automatic translation
#: vi.docbook:157
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Vi marks and <link linkend=\"kate-part-bookmarks\">&kate; bookmarks</link> "
"are integrated. When a mark is created in Vi Mode, a corresponding &kate; "
"bookmark is created and appears in the <guimenu>Bookmarks</guimenu> menu. "
"Conversely, when a &kate; bookmark is created, a corresponding Vi mark at "
"the 0 column is also created."
msgstr ""
"वि चिह्नानि च<link linkend=\"kate-part-bookmarks\"> &amp;कते; "
"पुस्तकचिह्नानि</link> एकीकृताः भवन्ति। यदा Vi Mode मध्ये चिह्नं निर्मीयते "
"तदा तत्सम्बद्धं &amp;kate; bookmark निर्मितं भवति तथा च मध्ये "
"दृश्यते<guimenu> बुकमार्क्स</guimenu> मेनू। विपरीततः यदा &amp;kate; "
"bookmark निर्मितं भवति, 0 स्तम्भे तत्सम्बद्धं Vi चिह्नम् अपि निर्मितं भवति ।"

